IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4DtHVTFxbYC2i3dgvOWuSQY1vRM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4DtHVTFxbYC2i3dgvOWuSQY1vRM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45783/season/3/episode/21"},{"id":"1209278","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Un avvertimento","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"La partita entra nell'ultimo periodo. Hyuga torna in campo dopo avere capito come battere Mibuchi e Kiyoshi affronta Nebuya nonostante il dolore al ginocchio.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-06-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vEqIq7AYv13FiNefu5zRgWJAmK3.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vEqIq7AYv13FiNefu5zRgWJAmK3.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45783/season/3/episode/22"},{"id":"1209279","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Perché non ci arrendiamo","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Il tempo scorre implacabile. Kuroko propone a Kagami di allearsi contro Akashi, che è entrato nella \"Zone\" diventando praticamente imbattibile.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-06-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.3,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dvj6ZLP2gmA9wkXUR9dsZ0rzQwF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dvj6ZLP2gmA9wkXUR9dsZ0rzQwF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45783/season/3/episode/23"},{"id":"1209280","seasonNumber":3,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Allora eri tu","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Akashi torna a essere quello di sempre e riprende a giocare con la squadra, incitando i compagni a dare il massimo per battere la Seirin.","language":"it-IT"},"airDateText":{"value":"2015-06-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rat